WEBVTT

01:30.890 --> 01:34.979
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.050 --> 01:37.910
[Episode 18]

01:39.920 --> 01:41.140
Tomorrow, you two brothers

01:41.140 --> 01:42.479
will carry thorny branches on your backs

01:42.479 --> 01:44.680
and come with me
to the Tea Merchants' Association.

01:44.680 --> 01:45.680
Perhaps Mr. Hou Er

01:45.710 --> 01:46.759
will let it go.

01:46.789 --> 01:47.789
-That's right.
-Yeah.

01:47.789 --> 01:48.640
Will you do it?

01:49.150 --> 01:49.590
No.

01:50.680 --> 01:51.580
Why should I?

01:51.680 --> 01:52.400
I'm not going.

01:52.400 --> 01:53.800
If you don't go, who will?

01:55.210 --> 01:55.710
Listen here,

01:55.710 --> 01:56.640
you two

01:56.680 --> 01:57.780
can't keep causing trouble like this!

01:57.780 --> 01:59.150
The beating you got last time
wasn't enough for you,

01:59.150 --> 01:59.640
was it?

02:00.000 --> 02:01.700
Just look at him.

02:02.840 --> 02:04.840
Apologizing with thorns on my back.

02:09.190 --> 02:09.800
Fine.

02:11.280 --> 02:13.210
I can carry those thorny branches,

02:13.680 --> 02:15.210
and I can admit my mistakes.

02:16.230 --> 02:18.230
As long as it's good for our village,

02:18.310 --> 02:19.310
even if Hou Er

02:19.360 --> 02:20.490
slaps me a few times,

02:21.150 --> 02:21.950
it's worth it.

02:25.750 --> 02:27.079
But let me ask you all—

02:28.910 --> 02:29.800
then what?

02:31.960 --> 02:32.520
It's not like I

02:32.520 --> 02:34.310
carried his child and jumped into a well,

02:34.310 --> 02:36.110
so why would he hate me this much?

02:37.150 --> 02:37.990
He just wants to force down

02:37.990 --> 02:39.240
the price of my tea.

02:40.170 --> 02:41.329
If, at this moment,

02:41.360 --> 02:42.800
I go bow and scrape to him,

02:43.750 --> 02:44.730
he'll use the chance

02:44.730 --> 02:46.310
to push down the price of all the tea

02:46.310 --> 02:47.910
in the village even further.

02:48.120 --> 02:49.590
So what about the tea you have now?

02:49.590 --> 02:50.850
Will you sell it or not?

02:53.120 --> 02:54.280
Will you sell it or not?

02:54.280 --> 02:54.910
He's trying to slash the price.

02:54.910 --> 02:56.040
Will you sell or not?

03:00.590 --> 03:02.880
Today, my brother and I

03:03.750 --> 03:05.150
went through every tea shop

03:05.150 --> 03:06.000
in town.

03:07.030 --> 03:08.190
Right now, top-grade Silver Bud

03:08.190 --> 03:10.250
sells for 3.3 strings of coins per jin

03:10.360 --> 03:12.150
on the market.

03:12.450 --> 03:13.780
-That high?
-That high?

03:14.360 --> 03:14.910
-So high!
-Yeah.

03:14.910 --> 03:15.800
Second-grade

03:16.360 --> 03:17.490
sells for 2 strings.

03:17.770 --> 03:19.280
Even the third-grade Silver Bud

03:19.280 --> 03:21.070
can sell for 1.7 strings.

03:21.680 --> 03:22.410
1.7 strings?

03:22.430 --> 03:23.590
-That's so high.
-Exactly.

03:23.590 --> 03:24.390
But that Hou Er

03:24.750 --> 03:25.840
simply offers

03:26.040 --> 03:27.510
only 1.3 strings

03:27.560 --> 03:29.190
for my best tea leaves.

03:29.870 --> 03:30.750
And the price difference

03:30.750 --> 03:31.630
will all go

03:31.710 --> 03:33.170
straight into his pocket.

03:33.790 --> 03:34.840
Are we here every day

03:34.840 --> 03:36.500
working so hard, growing tea,

03:36.550 --> 03:38.240
breaking our backs without rest,

03:38.240 --> 03:40.100
just to make that Hou fellow rich?

03:40.680 --> 03:42.940
-Hou Er is really despicable!
-Exactly!

03:45.030 --> 03:46.100
Next time he comes to the village,

03:46.100 --> 03:47.630
we should beat him to death!

03:47.710 --> 03:48.910
-Kill him!
-Kill him!

03:51.150 --> 03:52.079
Enough, enough!

03:53.680 --> 03:54.079
Gu,

03:54.400 --> 03:56.380
stop saying those useless things.

03:56.680 --> 03:58.880
Just tell us what we should do now.

03:58.900 --> 03:59.680
It's not like tea merchants
across the country

03:59.680 --> 04:00.840
have all died out.

04:01.890 --> 04:04.190
Since when is
the Tea Merchants' Association

04:04.190 --> 04:05.320
the imperial court?

04:05.520 --> 04:06.720
Is it the government?

04:07.160 --> 04:08.760
Does it hold absolute power?

04:10.880 --> 04:12.610
Our Anhui tea has major clients

04:13.030 --> 04:13.890
in the capital,

04:14.450 --> 04:15.510
in Inner Mongolia,

04:15.630 --> 04:16.829
and in the Northwest.

04:16.970 --> 04:19.560
I can handle
all those distribution channels myself.

04:19.560 --> 04:20.620
But at this moment,

04:21.040 --> 04:22.580
I hope you can trust me

04:23.260 --> 04:25.880
and stand together through this.

04:26.510 --> 04:28.450
This isn't about trust.

04:28.570 --> 04:30.230
You need to show us

04:30.720 --> 04:31.840
t-the real money.

04:32.260 --> 04:32.980
That's right.

04:32.980 --> 04:33.390
Yes.

04:33.430 --> 04:34.000
Exactly.

04:35.030 --> 04:35.650
Indeed.

04:37.510 --> 04:38.640
Then how about this:

04:39.720 --> 04:40.510
I'll buy

04:40.560 --> 04:41.920
all the tea you have in stock

04:41.920 --> 04:43.240
at 10 percent above the price offered

04:43.240 --> 04:44.360
by the Tea Merchants' Association

04:44.360 --> 04:45.360
down the mountain.

04:45.360 --> 04:46.360
What do you think?

04:46.600 --> 04:48.190
-Good.
-Yes!

04:48.190 --> 04:48.630
Alright!

04:48.630 --> 04:49.720
-Yes!
-Yes!

04:49.720 --> 04:50.270
Deal!

04:51.070 --> 04:51.600
Gu,

04:51.960 --> 04:54.090
let's not make decisions out of anger.

04:54.950 --> 04:56.490
You don't have that much money!

04:56.490 --> 04:57.820
Don't worry about that.

04:58.070 --> 04:58.890
Everyone,

04:59.380 --> 05:00.510
we have a deal, then.

05:01.470 --> 05:02.730
Give me a few more days.

05:03.320 --> 05:04.850
We'll trade in hard silver.

05:05.000 --> 05:05.820
-Alright!
-That works!

05:05.820 --> 05:06.820
-Okay!
-Alright!

05:06.920 --> 05:08.050
Hard silver is good.

05:10.470 --> 05:11.120
Gu!

05:11.590 --> 05:12.180
Gu!

05:13.140 --> 05:13.940
Are you crazy?

05:15.360 --> 05:15.920
You see?

05:16.050 --> 05:16.910
Gu has gone mad,

05:17.000 --> 05:18.480
completely mad!

05:19.820 --> 05:20.270
Pingyuan,

05:20.270 --> 05:21.800
why are you being so reckless again?

05:21.800 --> 05:22.360
You shouldn't have

05:22.360 --> 05:23.430
said that just now.

05:23.690 --> 05:25.040
Then what should I have said?

05:25.040 --> 05:26.000
I thought about it the whole way back.

05:26.000 --> 05:26.680
I have a solution.

05:26.680 --> 05:30.000
[Blessings and Auspiciousness]

05:26.860 --> 05:27.470
Ask me.

05:27.830 --> 05:29.560
Tell me, what's your solution?

05:30.730 --> 05:31.790
If you ask me,

05:32.040 --> 05:33.570
I think you should run away.

05:33.750 --> 05:35.090
Even if we don't go to apologize,

05:35.090 --> 05:37.020
someone else will naturally do it.

05:38.510 --> 05:39.240
Listen to me—

05:39.390 --> 05:41.970
early tomorrow morning,
make a trip to Shanxi.

05:41.970 --> 05:43.430
Take two assistants with you

05:43.430 --> 05:44.530
to deliver a letter for me.

05:44.530 --> 05:45.330
Find Madam Jin

05:45.770 --> 05:46.450
and tell her

05:46.600 --> 05:47.620
that I need to borrow some money.

05:47.620 --> 05:48.960
So you're planning to borrow money?

05:48.960 --> 05:50.680
How much should we borrow then?

05:50.680 --> 05:52.409
Fifty to sixty thousand taels.

05:54.300 --> 05:55.390
Don't put me through this.

05:55.390 --> 05:56.600
Tomorrow I'll carry the thorny branches

05:56.600 --> 05:57.400
to apologize!

06:08.430 --> 06:09.630
Pingyuan! Pingyuan!

06:10.570 --> 06:18.540
[Abode of Virtue]

06:21.870 --> 06:23.000
Is Mr. Bayan at home?

06:26.950 --> 06:28.120
That's me.

06:28.560 --> 06:29.890
You're too polite, sir.

06:30.070 --> 06:31.200
What can I do for you?

06:31.760 --> 06:32.600
I know that you

06:32.630 --> 06:34.070
have been doing the tea business

06:34.070 --> 06:35.120
between Huizhou and the grassland.

06:35.120 --> 06:36.240
I'm a local tea merchant.

06:36.240 --> 06:36.720
I've brought some

06:36.720 --> 06:37.680
tea samples

06:37.700 --> 06:38.500
for you to try.

06:38.750 --> 06:40.420
[Floating Clouds and Endless Winds]

06:38.800 --> 06:40.530
What goes around comes around.

06:43.800 --> 06:45.659
Let me tell you something, Mr. Gu.

06:45.950 --> 06:46.800
All the tea merchants

06:46.800 --> 06:48.060
staying at this inn

06:48.159 --> 06:50.190
are my friends.

06:50.870 --> 06:52.200
Here's some advice,

06:52.530 --> 06:53.680
free of charge—

06:53.920 --> 06:55.120
get lost!

06:55.750 --> 06:58.980
That's what you get for defying
the Tea Merchants' Association!

06:58.980 --> 07:01.490
[Abode of Virtue]

07:10.510 --> 07:12.240
Hu Yutai, along with

07:12.560 --> 07:13.830
the Anhui Tea Merchants' Association,

07:13.830 --> 07:15.920
is awaiting Mr. Li here.

07:19.040 --> 07:19.840
Old Master Hu.

07:20.160 --> 07:20.920
Mr. Li.

07:21.360 --> 07:21.820
Please.

07:21.950 --> 07:22.310
Please.

07:22.310 --> 07:23.240
Please, please.

07:26.680 --> 07:28.630
All of Anhui's top-grade teas this year—

07:28.630 --> 07:29.290
Melon Seed,

07:29.720 --> 07:30.380
Silver Bud,

07:30.480 --> 07:31.140
and Hou Kui—

07:31.310 --> 07:33.040
I'll buy them all at full price.

07:33.159 --> 07:34.220
That's wonderful.

07:34.560 --> 07:35.620
With your arrival,

07:35.870 --> 07:37.330
I can finally feel at ease.

07:37.900 --> 07:40.100
However, the reason we invited you here

07:40.360 --> 07:42.870
is that we,
the Anhui Tea Merchants' Association,

07:42.870 --> 07:44.700
have a special request

07:44.800 --> 07:46.940
and hope you can help us.

07:47.950 --> 07:49.390
The Grand Tea Competition?

07:49.390 --> 07:50.450
Exactly, exactly.

07:51.070 --> 07:51.880
This time,

07:51.950 --> 07:53.760
our Anhui tea must

07:54.120 --> 07:55.850
win first place no matter what.

07:56.950 --> 07:57.680
Everyone,

07:57.720 --> 07:58.560
please sit, sit.

07:58.560 --> 07:59.870
-Sit. Sit.
-Let's sit.

08:03.800 --> 08:05.330
You've probably all heard.

08:05.560 --> 08:06.490
The late Emperor

08:06.550 --> 08:07.680
passed away in Rehe.

08:08.310 --> 08:10.040
The capital has new rulers now.

08:10.690 --> 08:12.360
The former Noble Consort Yi

08:12.390 --> 08:14.950
and the Sixth Prince
jointly oversee state affairs.

08:14.950 --> 08:16.680
The new reign title is Tongzhi.

08:17.390 --> 08:18.160
"Tongzhi"

08:19.160 --> 08:20.810
means the ruler and ministers
governing together,

08:20.810 --> 08:24.270
and also brother-in-law and sister-in-law
ruling together.

08:24.310 --> 08:25.770
That's good, that's good.

08:26.510 --> 08:28.310
I'm not just making small talk here.

08:28.310 --> 08:30.390
Nominally, the Grand Tea Competition

08:30.390 --> 08:31.720
is hosted by our family,

08:31.800 --> 08:34.789
but the one actually tasting
and judging the tea

08:35.200 --> 08:36.330
is the Sixth Prince.

08:37.360 --> 08:38.090
The Sixth...

08:38.240 --> 08:40.039
That isn't just a tea gathering.

08:40.270 --> 08:41.390
It's business.

08:44.610 --> 08:46.810
Your Anhui tea wants to win first place.

08:46.840 --> 08:48.640
Then, what about Yunnan tea

08:48.670 --> 08:49.530
and Taiwan tea?

08:50.120 --> 08:52.360
There are many subtleties involved.

08:54.630 --> 08:55.440
Old Master Hu.

08:57.030 --> 08:57.750
What is it?

08:58.440 --> 08:59.210
There's a

08:59.240 --> 09:00.150
young tea merchant outside.

09:00.150 --> 09:01.030
He sent his calling card,

09:01.030 --> 09:04.430
saying he wants to meet
with the Tea Merchants' Association.

09:06.750 --> 09:08.470
This person is too arrogant.

09:09.030 --> 09:10.550
It's clearly the Silver Bud,

09:10.550 --> 09:11.910
and he has the nerve
to call it Orchid Snow.

09:11.910 --> 09:13.030
Send him away. I won't see him.

09:13.030 --> 09:13.720
Orchid Snow tea—

09:13.720 --> 09:15.030
that's quite a lovely name.

09:15.030 --> 09:15.910
Come on, let me take a look

09:15.910 --> 09:16.970
and see who this is.

09:19.240 --> 09:20.730
No manners whatsoever.

09:21.150 --> 09:22.680
What kind of person is this?

09:24.150 --> 09:25.810
An old acquaintance of yours.

09:28.720 --> 09:29.720
[To Old Master Hu, head of
Anhui Tea Merchants' Association]

09:29.720 --> 09:30.400
[Greetings from Gu Pingyuan]

09:36.480 --> 09:37.650
Old Master Hu says

09:37.750 --> 09:38.960
he's too busy to see you.

09:38.960 --> 09:40.270
He's discussing business with guests.

09:40.270 --> 09:40.670
Here.

09:40.750 --> 09:42.010
Your card is returned.

09:42.320 --> 09:43.120
Please leave.

09:43.200 --> 09:44.260
Who are the guests?

09:44.870 --> 09:45.610
Gu!

09:49.440 --> 09:50.150
Mr. Li Qin.

09:50.330 --> 09:51.180
I knew it.

09:51.200 --> 09:52.260
You must be the one.

09:52.360 --> 09:53.390
Alright, let's not talk here.

09:53.390 --> 09:53.920
Let's go.

09:55.560 --> 09:56.840
How did you manage

09:56.870 --> 09:57.390
to offend that Hu fellow

09:57.390 --> 09:59.120
right after arriving in Anhui?

09:59.120 --> 10:01.270
That old man's brain is stuck in the mud.

10:01.270 --> 10:03.870
As if he'd ever look kindly
on someone like you.

10:04.200 --> 10:05.330
Listen to me on this.

10:05.750 --> 10:06.810
I'll find a chance.

10:07.710 --> 10:08.880
I'll think of a way to smooth things over

10:08.880 --> 10:10.010
between you and him.

10:10.630 --> 10:11.570
You came

10:11.630 --> 10:13.830
with your father this time, didn't you?

10:14.200 --> 10:15.050
Back in Shanxi,

10:15.050 --> 10:16.520
I offended him terribly.

10:17.870 --> 10:19.530
Counting on him to help me now?

10:19.720 --> 10:20.320
Forget it.

10:22.120 --> 10:22.910
True enough.

10:25.360 --> 10:26.030
Well then,

10:26.760 --> 10:27.600
I know some

10:27.630 --> 10:28.830
local tea merchants.

10:29.240 --> 10:30.590
I'll pay out of my own pocket

10:30.590 --> 10:31.630
to have them buy

10:31.670 --> 10:32.400
all your tea.

10:32.630 --> 10:34.560
Anyway, I won't let you lose money.

10:36.870 --> 10:38.330
Just hearing you say that,

10:38.600 --> 10:40.080
I'm deeply grateful.

10:41.700 --> 10:46.180
[Orchid Snow]

10:44.360 --> 10:46.440
It's only that the Orchid Snow tea of mine

10:46.440 --> 10:47.900
is like a timeless beauty.

10:48.910 --> 10:50.360
If it only mingles among common,

10:49.970 --> 10:53.290
[Orchid Snow]

10:50.360 --> 10:51.670
vulgar teas,

10:52.000 --> 10:54.200
I think that would be too much of a waste.

10:55.670 --> 10:58.930
[Orchid Snow]

11:00.480 --> 11:01.080
Let me try.

11:06.600 --> 11:07.630
Orchid Snow.

11:14.390 --> 11:15.390
What do you think?

11:21.030 --> 11:22.690
Truly like a stunning beauty.

11:22.860 --> 11:24.360
You indeed are a kindred spirit,

11:24.360 --> 11:25.890
willing to speak the truth.

11:26.720 --> 11:27.780
But what's the use?

11:29.120 --> 11:29.960
The tea merchants in Beijing

11:29.960 --> 11:31.290
all listen to my father.

11:31.630 --> 11:33.080
And you've offended

11:33.120 --> 11:35.580
the Anhui Tea Merchants' Association here.

11:35.960 --> 11:37.500
Such fine tea—what a pity.

11:38.000 --> 11:39.540
Or sell it to the Mongolians.

11:39.540 --> 11:40.630
I've already offended

11:40.630 --> 11:41.960
all the Mongolians too.

11:42.350 --> 11:42.910
Wait,

11:43.550 --> 11:44.340
why do you cause chaos

11:44.340 --> 11:45.850
wherever you go?

11:46.180 --> 11:47.310
You think I want to?

11:48.120 --> 11:49.520
I'm just a tea farmer now.

11:49.700 --> 11:50.390
My whole family depends on me

11:50.390 --> 11:51.900
selling tea to put food on the table.

11:51.900 --> 11:53.120
Those bloodsucking tea buyers

11:53.120 --> 11:53.930
push the prices so low.

11:53.930 --> 11:55.260
What am I supposed to do?

11:55.520 --> 11:56.780
Just let them bully me?

12:00.060 --> 12:01.920
I think you've reached a dead end.

12:03.550 --> 12:04.750
I've come to realize—

12:04.990 --> 12:05.670
maybe in this life

12:05.670 --> 12:07.240
I'm destined to end up at a dead end.

12:07.240 --> 12:08.370
I'm used to it by now.

12:10.610 --> 12:11.550
That Grand Tea Competition

12:11.550 --> 12:12.880
your family is hosting—

12:13.550 --> 12:14.880
could my Orchid Snow tea

12:14.910 --> 12:16.170
win the championship?

12:17.670 --> 12:18.470
Sure it could.

12:19.370 --> 12:21.120
Orchid Snow tea takes the crown,

12:21.120 --> 12:22.360
and then you pass the Imperial Exam
to become top scholar—

12:22.360 --> 12:24.900
parade through town on horseback
and rise to high office.

12:24.900 --> 12:25.750
You're having

12:25.750 --> 12:27.000
quite a sweet daydream here.

12:27.000 --> 12:27.870
Do you want me to kick you

12:27.870 --> 12:28.890
into the lake?

12:28.960 --> 12:30.420
You're always mocking me.

12:31.150 --> 12:32.420
But honestly,

12:33.320 --> 12:34.270
if you really want to attend

12:34.270 --> 12:36.330
our family's Grand Tea Competition,

12:36.660 --> 12:37.670
I can find a way

12:37.670 --> 12:38.440
to get you in.

12:39.440 --> 12:40.380
But after that,

12:40.870 --> 12:41.930
you are on your own.

12:46.390 --> 12:47.290
I'm at a dead end anyway.

12:47.290 --> 12:48.440
What's there to fear?

12:48.440 --> 12:49.770
I'm counting on you now.

13:03.910 --> 13:04.510
Father.

13:27.840 --> 13:28.970
Where did you get it?

13:30.670 --> 13:31.240
Father,

13:31.910 --> 13:34.080
this is the Orchid Snow tea.

13:42.150 --> 13:43.410
How kind of you.

13:44.480 --> 13:46.480
Willing to put in a good word for him.

13:47.910 --> 13:49.670
This might even be better

13:49.720 --> 13:51.240
than the top-grade Silver Bud tea.

13:51.240 --> 13:53.840
I think there's
real business potential here.

14:02.070 --> 14:03.060
I think

14:03.390 --> 14:04.480
that old man Hu

14:04.500 --> 14:05.630
is being too overbearing.

14:05.630 --> 14:06.550
Such good tea—

14:07.080 --> 14:08.370
just because it doesn't suit his taste,

14:08.370 --> 14:10.120
he rejects it without a second thought.

14:10.120 --> 14:10.940
If you ask me,

14:11.240 --> 14:12.460
if we could have

14:12.510 --> 14:13.510
this Orchid Snow tea

14:13.510 --> 14:14.200
for sale in our own tea shops

14:14.200 --> 14:15.200
every year,

14:15.480 --> 14:16.610
wouldn't that be...

14:22.870 --> 14:23.840
You've been

14:23.870 --> 14:25.510
paying close attention
to the family business lately.

14:25.510 --> 14:26.240
That's good.

14:27.440 --> 14:28.360
Such excellent tea—

14:28.360 --> 14:30.120
if we have exclusive rights to sell it,

14:30.120 --> 14:31.320
it'd be wonderful.

14:35.030 --> 14:37.220
But it's Gu Pingyuan's tea,

14:37.960 --> 14:39.490
which changes everything.

14:41.550 --> 14:42.440
Why is that?

14:47.440 --> 14:48.240
Let me ask you—

14:48.870 --> 14:50.630
if we buy his Orchid Snow tea,

14:50.630 --> 14:52.030
what would happen to him?

14:54.600 --> 14:55.930
I doubt that Hu fellow

14:55.960 --> 14:57.690
would dare to fall out with you.

14:57.750 --> 14:58.750
We can just buy it.

14:58.880 --> 15:00.810
Would he dare offend our Li family?

15:02.630 --> 15:03.670
You have a point,

15:04.910 --> 15:06.640
but he would harbor resentment

15:07.200 --> 15:08.860
because we made him lose face.

15:10.330 --> 15:11.640
If our competitors

15:11.670 --> 15:13.150
chose this moment to approach him,

15:13.150 --> 15:14.680
we'd lose him immediately.

15:14.960 --> 15:16.750
Our years of business relationship

15:16.750 --> 15:17.550
would be gone.

15:19.670 --> 15:20.790
Besides, his tea

15:21.790 --> 15:23.590
has limited annual production.

15:24.080 --> 15:26.190
With our hundreds of stores,

15:26.510 --> 15:28.360
could we really rely on the tea alone

15:28.360 --> 15:29.760
to sustain our business?

15:30.630 --> 15:32.690
Even if none of those issues existed,

15:33.370 --> 15:34.200
by doing this,

15:34.910 --> 15:36.370
wouldn't I be encouraging

15:36.390 --> 15:38.010
people like Gu Pingyuan

15:38.240 --> 15:39.720
who seek attention

15:39.790 --> 15:41.790
and emboldening such young people?

15:42.080 --> 15:42.870
One day,

15:43.630 --> 15:44.790
would he demand to share

15:44.790 --> 15:46.390
the profits with us equally?

15:46.670 --> 15:47.870
Or would he simply

15:47.910 --> 15:48.620
take everything and sell it,

15:48.620 --> 15:50.080
no longer working with us?

15:52.550 --> 15:53.550
It's just like

15:53.620 --> 15:55.720
Xiang Yu meeting the First Emperor of Qin

15:55.720 --> 15:57.380
and wanting to take his place.

15:57.670 --> 15:58.800
It's very possible.

16:00.030 --> 16:01.380
Ambition, you see...

16:02.120 --> 16:03.030
It's like

16:03.670 --> 16:05.080
a fire in one's heart.

16:06.360 --> 16:07.430
Easy to ignite,

16:08.200 --> 16:09.530
but hard to extinguish.

16:10.240 --> 16:11.030
In this world,

16:11.030 --> 16:12.430
rules always come first.

16:13.390 --> 16:14.590
And what are "rules"?

16:15.240 --> 16:15.960
I am the father,

16:15.960 --> 16:17.000
and you are the son.

16:17.000 --> 16:18.390
When I meet guests while seated,

16:18.390 --> 16:19.850
you must remain standing.

16:20.270 --> 16:21.930
If even this cannot be upheld,

16:22.200 --> 16:23.800
what business is there to do?

16:36.510 --> 16:37.480
Remember this:

16:39.870 --> 16:43.330
even the finest herbs must be removed
when they block the path.

16:44.140 --> 16:45.510
I've already instructed every merchant

16:45.510 --> 16:46.600
in the capital

16:46.720 --> 16:48.320
not to buy Gu Pingyuan's tea.

16:49.000 --> 16:51.150
And you—don't play tricks behind my back.

16:51.150 --> 16:51.980
If I find out,

16:52.080 --> 16:53.080
I won't spare you.

17:08.720 --> 17:10.450
How did you get back so quickly?

17:10.680 --> 17:12.109
Next time, could you please
assign me tasks

17:12.109 --> 17:14.569
that a human being
can actually accomplish?

17:16.230 --> 17:17.069
The things you make me do—

17:17.069 --> 17:18.440
what kind of tasks are these?

17:18.440 --> 17:19.790
I'm just not capable of
doing them for you.

17:19.790 --> 17:21.490
I didn't get a single coin!

17:29.030 --> 17:30.410
There's boiled water inside.

17:30.410 --> 17:31.200
You're drinking raw water like this—

17:31.200 --> 17:32.020
aren't you afraid of getting diarrhea?

17:32.020 --> 17:33.070
If I die from diarrhea,

17:33.070 --> 17:34.470
I'll finally have peace.

17:39.880 --> 17:41.000
All the way back here,

17:41.000 --> 17:42.110
I've been so worried.

17:42.110 --> 17:43.830
You've already made those big promises,

17:43.830 --> 17:44.640
and soon everyone in the village

17:44.640 --> 17:45.350
will bring their tea

17:45.350 --> 17:46.550
with their palms up, asking for money.

17:46.550 --> 17:48.160
Won't that drive us to our graves?

17:48.160 --> 17:49.480
Mother's legs aren't what they used to be,

17:49.480 --> 17:50.830
and she'll have to flee with us by then.

17:50.830 --> 17:51.560
How pitiful.

17:51.920 --> 17:52.640
Did you get to

17:52.640 --> 17:53.440
see Madam Jin or not?

17:53.440 --> 17:54.110
I didn't even catch

17:54.110 --> 17:55.240
a glimpse of that Madam Jin

17:55.240 --> 17:56.100
you mentioned.

17:56.350 --> 17:57.550
I handed in your note,

17:57.640 --> 17:58.510
and they said Madam Jin

17:58.510 --> 17:59.740
went out of town to check on some...

17:59.740 --> 18:00.740
some branch shop,

18:00.750 --> 18:02.950
and they don't know when she'll be back.

18:03.000 --> 18:04.070
Good grief.

18:04.240 --> 18:04.920
We might be able to wait,

18:04.920 --> 18:06.350
but the tea can't wait!

18:06.880 --> 18:07.450
Besides,

18:07.680 --> 18:09.180
with that scrap of paper you wrote,

18:09.180 --> 18:10.680
and you're asking for
50,000 or 60,000 taels—

18:10.680 --> 18:11.960
why should they lend you money?

18:11.960 --> 18:13.690
Can you please smarten up a bit?

18:14.160 --> 18:15.200
Hey, you're really getting into

18:15.200 --> 18:16.800
scolding me now, aren't you?

18:17.750 --> 18:19.160
I won't say anything more.

18:19.160 --> 18:20.310
I'm thick-skinned anyway.

18:20.310 --> 18:21.440
My life is worthless.

18:21.440 --> 18:23.420
Tomorrow I'll go apologize
with thorny branches on my back.

18:23.420 --> 18:24.330
Drink some boiled water

18:24.330 --> 18:26.330
and wash your feet before sleeping!

18:27.500 --> 18:28.400
If I ever listen to you again,

18:28.400 --> 18:29.660
I'm a complete donkey.

18:34.850 --> 18:42.750
[Silver Bud]

18:35.950 --> 18:36.880
Put them inside.

18:37.440 --> 18:38.040
All right.

18:38.830 --> 18:39.630
Okay.

18:40.110 --> 18:40.790
Put it here.

18:41.070 --> 18:41.440
Okay.

18:42.830 --> 18:43.400
Careful.

18:43.420 --> 18:44.080
Zhu Laosan,

18:44.200 --> 18:45.200
you're the craftiest one here.

18:45.200 --> 18:46.480
Don't you short me on the weight.

18:46.480 --> 18:46.920
I won't, I won't.

18:46.920 --> 18:47.660
Come on, come on.

18:47.660 --> 18:50.120
[Silver Bud]

18:49.810 --> 18:51.140
Thank you, Mr. Pingwen.

18:57.030 --> 18:57.840
I'm taking it to your home.

18:57.130 --> 19:00.230
[Blessings and Auspiciousness]

18:57.870 --> 18:59.110
Put the tea here.

18:59.790 --> 19:00.640
Thank you, Mr. Pingwen.

19:00.640 --> 19:01.900
Where's your brother?

19:03.620 --> 19:06.270
[Blessings and Auspiciousness]

19:04.640 --> 19:05.510
Okay, okay.

19:07.510 --> 19:08.330
Mrs. Gu.

19:08.380 --> 19:09.310
Having your meal?

19:09.310 --> 19:10.730
Would you like to join us?

19:11.480 --> 19:12.920
I'll pass, but thanks.

19:12.960 --> 19:14.960
Now that the tea is sold,

19:15.270 --> 19:16.070
half the weight on my heart

19:16.070 --> 19:17.190
is lifted.

19:17.440 --> 19:19.040
That's better than any meal.

19:20.510 --> 19:20.920
Right?

19:21.070 --> 19:21.640
Right.

19:23.090 --> 19:24.090
Um...

19:25.680 --> 19:27.560
I have a cousin
who lives at the foot of the mountain.

19:27.560 --> 19:29.050
He's got some good tea too.

19:30.000 --> 19:31.030
You think we brothers

19:31.030 --> 19:32.630
are rich suckers, don't you?

19:32.720 --> 19:34.260
Your cousin's tea?

19:34.590 --> 19:36.190
What about your uncle's tea?

19:36.550 --> 19:37.470
You want

19:37.510 --> 19:38.160
my uncle's tea too?

19:38.160 --> 19:39.820
We want all your family's tea!

19:39.920 --> 19:40.580
This kid...

19:40.680 --> 19:42.210
How can you speak like that?

19:43.350 --> 19:44.080
We'll buy it.

19:44.480 --> 19:45.410
Spread the word—

19:45.590 --> 19:47.250
besides tea from our village,

19:47.270 --> 19:48.540
I'll take tea from other villages too.

19:48.540 --> 19:49.640
But there's one condition:

19:49.640 --> 19:51.270
I'll only buy first-grade tea.

19:51.270 --> 19:52.510
Second or third grade—forget it.

19:52.510 --> 19:53.770
For all the tea I purchase,

19:53.770 --> 19:55.190
I'll still add 10% to the price.

19:55.190 --> 19:56.590
In the next couple of days,
I'll have Pingwen

19:56.590 --> 19:57.670
bring the money to you

19:57.670 --> 19:59.080
so you can have peace of mind.

19:59.080 --> 19:59.690
Really?

20:01.070 --> 20:03.000
Then I'll tell everyone just that.

20:04.750 --> 20:05.400
Thanks!

20:06.030 --> 20:07.090
Thank you, Mrs. Gu.

20:08.950 --> 20:09.880
Thank you, Mr. Pingwen.

20:09.880 --> 20:11.210
Thank you, Mr. Pingwen.

20:12.680 --> 20:13.940
I'll take my leave now.

20:20.310 --> 20:21.000
Mother.

20:21.510 --> 20:22.400
We have a hen at home.

20:22.400 --> 20:23.720
Let's kill it and stew it.

20:23.720 --> 20:24.820
It's doing so well.

20:25.160 --> 20:26.830
Didn't you want to keep it for eggs?

20:26.830 --> 20:27.510
Eggs?

20:28.270 --> 20:29.920
We can't even afford to
eat an egg anymore.

20:29.920 --> 20:31.790
Haven't you heard? We're finished.

20:31.790 --> 20:33.000
My brother is dragging you and me

20:33.000 --> 20:34.200
straight to our doom.

20:38.590 --> 20:40.850
What are you two brothers talking about?

20:41.110 --> 20:42.110
You didn't see it.

20:42.400 --> 20:43.290
A few days ago,

20:43.510 --> 20:45.070
my brother got kicked in the head

20:45.070 --> 20:45.760
by a donkey.

20:45.920 --> 20:47.790
He bought all the tea in the village

20:47.790 --> 20:48.720
and laid it all outside.

20:48.720 --> 20:49.440
If you had seen it,

20:49.440 --> 20:50.480
you couldn't eat right now.

20:50.480 --> 20:52.000
You shouldn't talk about
your brother like that.

20:52.000 --> 20:52.790
No manners.

20:54.400 --> 20:55.030
Pingyuan.

20:55.790 --> 20:56.850
What are you doing?

20:57.310 --> 20:58.440
You heard him.

20:58.680 --> 21:00.210
I just bought a batch of tea.

21:00.400 --> 21:01.310
I opened

21:01.440 --> 21:03.100
a tea shop for Pingwen in town.

21:03.240 --> 21:04.720
We've got to
have something to sell, right?

21:04.720 --> 21:05.480
Enough, enough.

21:05.480 --> 21:07.080
Wipe that grin off your face.

21:07.110 --> 21:09.110
You think you're rich like Li Million

21:09.110 --> 21:10.560
with houses, land,

21:10.640 --> 21:11.880
and mountains of gold and silver?

21:11.880 --> 21:13.810
What are you using to pay everyone?

21:15.000 --> 21:15.880
Those thorny branches from last time—

21:15.880 --> 21:16.830
Pingyuan, put them on my back.

21:16.830 --> 21:18.130
I'll crawl into town.

21:18.200 --> 21:19.480
If I die halfway there, leave me there!

21:19.480 --> 21:20.740
I might as well be dead!

21:21.200 --> 21:22.480
Is Mr. Gu home?

21:22.590 --> 21:24.050
We don't want any more tea!

21:25.110 --> 21:26.890
[Blessings and Auspiciousness]

21:28.790 --> 21:29.620
Madam Jin,

21:29.650 --> 21:30.850
what brings you here?

21:32.690 --> 21:34.030
Madam Jin?

21:34.050 --> 21:35.470
So you're Madam Jin.

21:35.790 --> 21:37.070
This is your younger brother, right?

21:37.070 --> 21:38.240
Unfortunately, that day

21:38.240 --> 21:39.640
I happened to be at our Datong branch.

21:39.640 --> 21:41.030
They told me your brother had visited.

21:41.030 --> 21:41.920
He didn't get to eat

21:41.920 --> 21:42.750
or even have tea.

21:42.750 --> 21:43.830
I couldn't bear the thought of that.

21:43.830 --> 21:45.030
So I hurried over to apologize.

21:45.030 --> 21:45.900
I'm sorry.

21:46.160 --> 21:46.830
No need for that, really.

21:46.640 --> 21:50.590
[Blessings and Auspiciousness]

21:46.880 --> 21:48.340
Madam Jin, please come in.

21:50.480 --> 21:50.960
Mother!

21:52.000 --> 21:52.460
Mother,

21:52.490 --> 21:57.210
[Blessings and Auspiciousness]

21:52.580 --> 21:54.240
this is my friend from Shanxi.

21:56.330 --> 21:57.590
Greetings, Old Madam Gu.

21:57.590 --> 21:59.010
I wish you good health.

21:59.030 --> 22:00.400
Get up now, get up now.

22:01.230 --> 22:03.210
Please come with me inside for tea.

22:03.480 --> 22:04.070
Old Madam Gu,

22:04.070 --> 22:05.720
let me help you inside so we can talk.

22:05.610 --> 22:07.490
[Blessings and Auspiciousness]

22:06.310 --> 22:07.430
My husband and the others

22:07.430 --> 22:08.240
send their regards.

22:08.240 --> 22:09.030
I've also brought all the gifts

22:09.030 --> 22:09.910
they sent.

22:10.240 --> 22:11.170
Come in quickly!

22:11.310 --> 22:12.000
-Yes, Madam.
-Yes, Madam.

22:12.000 --> 22:12.650
Come on.

22:14.000 --> 22:14.660
Pingyuan,

22:15.030 --> 22:16.770
are those gifts real?

22:16.970 --> 22:18.170
You don't believe it?

22:18.240 --> 22:20.240
Open the boxes and see for yourself.

22:25.800 --> 22:26.540
Madam Jin,

22:26.670 --> 22:28.330
I really owe you one this time.

22:29.480 --> 22:30.260
Mr. Gu,

22:30.310 --> 22:31.880
the untamed spirit you display outside

22:31.880 --> 22:33.520
is kept in check at home, eh?

22:34.330 --> 22:36.060
It's quite interesting to see.

22:36.590 --> 22:37.440
After all, you are

22:37.440 --> 22:38.700
our Association Head!

22:39.070 --> 22:40.190
That's all made up.

22:40.510 --> 22:41.170
This boy...

22:41.400 --> 22:43.690
What Association Head
are you talking about?

22:43.690 --> 22:45.110
Let me explain to you, Old Madam Gu.

22:45.110 --> 22:45.880
Mr. Gu

22:46.000 --> 22:47.090
is the leader of our Shanxi

22:47.090 --> 22:48.640
Draft Bank Merchants' Association.

22:48.640 --> 22:50.550
Among the 3,000 draft banks in Shanxi,

22:50.550 --> 22:52.200
just one note from Mr. Gu

22:52.220 --> 22:53.550
and everyone will obey.

22:54.220 --> 22:55.880
Speaking of which, Association Head,
I should

22:55.880 --> 22:57.680
apologize for arriving a day late.

22:57.680 --> 22:59.200
No need for such formalities.

22:59.200 --> 22:59.680
Mother,

22:59.880 --> 23:01.580
Madam Jin is just teasing me.

23:02.700 --> 23:04.650
I have something to discuss

23:04.830 --> 23:06.200
with Madam Jin in private.

23:06.200 --> 23:06.800
All right.

23:07.750 --> 23:09.110
Our guest has come from afar,

23:09.110 --> 23:10.910
so you must take good care of her.

23:11.110 --> 23:12.920
We're country folk with simple manners.

23:12.920 --> 23:14.780
Please don't mind, Madam Jin.

23:15.200 --> 23:16.930
I don't deserve such courtesy,
Old Madam Gu.

23:16.930 --> 23:18.590
Please excuse us for a moment.

23:26.900 --> 23:27.660
Madam Jin, you don't have to

23:27.660 --> 23:29.190
come all this way yourself.

23:29.320 --> 23:30.290
When I left Shanxi,

23:30.290 --> 23:31.150
I made it clear.

23:31.480 --> 23:32.110
There would be no such thing

23:32.110 --> 23:33.270
as an association head anymore.

23:33.270 --> 23:34.600
Please stop teasing me.

23:35.920 --> 23:37.270
Mr. Gu, you can live here

23:37.310 --> 23:38.910
and still be so calm about it.

23:39.160 --> 23:40.900
You truly are a great hero.

23:42.440 --> 23:43.790
Those who offended you

23:44.070 --> 23:45.270
must be blind.

23:46.660 --> 23:47.880
I'm just a tea farmer now.

23:47.880 --> 23:49.080
Anyone can offend me.

23:50.110 --> 23:51.170
But you, Madam Jin,

23:51.550 --> 23:53.550
coming all this way
in your esteemed position—

23:53.550 --> 23:55.080
I feel truly sorry about it.

23:55.240 --> 23:56.770
That's where you're wrong.

23:57.110 --> 23:58.300
With our friendship,

23:58.300 --> 23:59.070
Mr. Gu,

23:59.400 --> 24:01.000
even across thousands of miles,

24:01.000 --> 24:02.730
I must come to you immediately.

24:02.920 --> 24:04.000
My husband is in poor health

24:04.000 --> 24:05.200
and not fit to travel.

24:05.240 --> 24:06.840
If I didn't come personally,

24:06.880 --> 24:08.480
I simply couldn't be at ease.

24:10.510 --> 24:11.750
To avoid any inconvenience in using it,

24:11.750 --> 24:12.440
I've exchanged everything

24:12.440 --> 24:14.550
for banknotes from the Four Major Banks
in the capital—

24:14.550 --> 24:15.310
10,000 taels each,

24:15.310 --> 24:16.310
20 notes in total.

24:16.350 --> 24:17.480
Redeemable in hard silver.

24:17.480 --> 24:18.880
I hope it's enough.

24:20.830 --> 24:22.110
I can't possibly use that much.

24:22.110 --> 24:23.500
If you can't use it all, just save it.

24:23.500 --> 24:24.450
My husband said

24:24.550 --> 24:25.940
it's rare for you to ask for help,

24:25.940 --> 24:27.870
so we're more than happy to assist.

24:27.980 --> 24:30.030
A small Anhui Tea Merchants' Association

24:30.030 --> 24:31.790
dares to stand in your way?

24:32.750 --> 24:33.550
They must have

24:33.590 --> 24:35.250
lost their minds completely.

24:35.720 --> 24:36.720
Just say the word,

24:36.750 --> 24:37.920
and we can buy up all the tea

24:37.920 --> 24:39.780
in Anhui province. It's nothing.

24:39.880 --> 24:41.640
Anyway, Mr. Li is in the tea business.

24:41.640 --> 24:43.300
He has plenty of connections.

24:44.300 --> 24:45.800
I'm just a tea farmer now,

24:45.880 --> 24:47.830
trying to prove a point to the villagers.

24:47.830 --> 24:48.680
I don't want to make

24:48.680 --> 24:50.010
such a big fuss about it.

24:50.240 --> 24:51.020
Anyway,

24:51.110 --> 24:51.750
here I must

24:51.860 --> 24:53.060
thank you, Madam Jin.

24:53.270 --> 24:53.870
All right,

24:54.000 --> 24:55.680
I'll follow your instructions.

24:55.680 --> 24:56.400
If there's nothing else,

24:56.400 --> 24:57.640
I'll take my leave now.

24:57.640 --> 24:58.960
The marketplace is like a battlefield—

24:58.960 --> 25:00.490
no moment should be wasted.

25:00.510 --> 25:01.350
Leaving so soon?

25:01.350 --> 25:02.720
Won't you stay for a meal?

25:02.720 --> 25:03.590
You think I came to Anhui

25:03.590 --> 25:04.440
just for you?

25:04.920 --> 25:06.670
I heard Hefei will be recaptured soon.

25:06.670 --> 25:07.870
All along my journey,

25:07.880 --> 25:09.000
I've been checking when we can

25:09.000 --> 25:10.460
open a branch office here.

25:10.680 --> 25:11.270
Mr. Gu,

25:11.640 --> 25:13.440
you have your way of doing business,

25:13.440 --> 25:14.750
and I have mine.

25:19.850 --> 25:20.540
Mr. Gu,

25:20.750 --> 25:22.350
no need to see me out further.

25:28.510 --> 25:30.040
She's as capable as any man.

25:30.350 --> 25:31.280
It's only right.

25:33.920 --> 25:34.880
Be more careful.

25:43.510 --> 25:44.570
Listen, everyone—

25:44.800 --> 25:45.880
all the tea

25:46.160 --> 25:48.260
should be stored separately
according to grade.

25:48.260 --> 25:49.960
If this warehouse isn't big enough,

25:49.960 --> 25:51.180
we can rent another one!

25:51.180 --> 25:52.090
My brother said

25:52.350 --> 25:54.010
that for anyone bringing tea,

25:54.070 --> 25:55.570
as long as it's top-grade,

25:55.780 --> 25:56.970
we should pay

25:57.000 --> 25:58.350
10% more
than the Tea Merchants' Association!

25:58.350 --> 25:58.830
Understand?

25:58.830 --> 25:59.490
-Yes!
-Yes!

26:01.920 --> 26:03.090
Mr. Pingwen, the boat has been rented.

26:03.090 --> 26:04.110
Please go check it out.

26:04.110 --> 26:05.240
Let's go take a look.

26:06.760 --> 26:09.180
[Ping]

26:11.290 --> 26:13.490
[Orchid]

26:18.030 --> 26:18.590
Look.

26:18.610 --> 26:20.970
[Orchid Snow]

26:19.270 --> 26:20.330
How's the writing?

26:23.070 --> 26:23.480
Pingyuan,

26:23.480 --> 26:26.140
you really have time
for such refined pursuits.

26:27.480 --> 26:29.510
I heard that the Grand Tea Competition

26:29.510 --> 26:31.000
doesn't allow individual participants.

26:31.000 --> 26:33.030
Only provincial
tea merchants' associations can attend.

26:33.030 --> 26:34.710
Rookies like us—

26:35.000 --> 26:36.060
will we be allowed?

26:37.030 --> 26:39.200
In this world, you have to take risks.

26:39.750 --> 26:40.240
What?

26:40.720 --> 26:41.520
Without them,

26:41.590 --> 26:42.880
we have no path forward?

26:42.880 --> 26:44.210
But aren't there rules?

26:44.350 --> 26:45.110
Rules?

26:46.310 --> 26:47.690
They set the rules.

26:48.000 --> 26:49.400
Those rules only benefit themselves.

26:49.400 --> 26:50.640
I have my own rules.

26:51.720 --> 26:52.740
Not for myself,

26:52.830 --> 26:54.110
but for this Orchid Snow tea,

26:54.110 --> 26:55.770
I must fight for recognition.

26:56.310 --> 26:57.270
Such a treasure

26:57.510 --> 26:59.510
going unappreciated in this world—

26:59.790 --> 27:01.200
wouldn't that be a crime in itself?

27:01.200 --> 27:01.880
By the way,

27:02.400 --> 27:03.530
arrange for someone

27:03.640 --> 27:04.960
to take care of our mother.

27:04.960 --> 27:05.690
After lunch,

27:05.750 --> 27:07.270
we'll set off for the capital.

27:07.270 --> 27:07.810
Really?

27:07.960 --> 27:09.580
The marketplace is like a battlefield.

27:09.580 --> 27:10.160
Some matters

27:10.160 --> 27:11.750
are as urgent as a raging fire.

27:11.750 --> 27:14.280
Delay even a moment,
and you'll answer for it.

27:19.700 --> 27:22.700
[Orchid Snow]

27:43.110 --> 27:43.790
Pingyuan.

27:45.530 --> 27:47.060
Why are you still up so late?

27:48.070 --> 27:48.820
Have a sip?

27:49.030 --> 27:51.600
[Orchid Snow]

27:49.110 --> 27:50.130
I don't want any.

27:50.550 --> 27:52.010
I'm completely wiped out.

27:55.640 --> 27:57.700
We're almost at the Shandong border.

27:58.370 --> 28:00.430
I originally thought that this time,

28:00.550 --> 28:02.080
I could live a peaceful life

28:03.020 --> 28:04.560
and take good care of our mother at home.

28:03.130 --> 28:06.850
[Orchid Snow]

28:05.240 --> 28:06.300
But I never thought

28:07.170 --> 28:08.900
I'd still be wandering around.

28:09.030 --> 28:10.230
This must be my fate.

28:11.100 --> 28:12.440
Speaking of which, this is my first time

28:12.440 --> 28:13.640
going to the capital.

28:15.590 --> 28:17.390
You want to stay quietly at home,

28:18.070 --> 28:20.200
but I kind of want to go out and explore.

28:21.130 --> 28:22.610
After getting married,

28:23.160 --> 28:25.560
with a wife and children
filling the house,

28:25.920 --> 28:28.250
I won't have time for such things anymore.

28:29.690 --> 28:30.800
Traveling around

28:31.270 --> 28:32.400
has its charms too.

28:36.880 --> 28:39.280
Have you seen the stars
over the grassland?

28:39.550 --> 28:40.410
The stars there

28:41.450 --> 28:43.980
are completely different
from the ones here—

28:44.410 --> 28:45.140
brighter...

28:46.730 --> 28:47.860
and more beautiful.

28:51.550 --> 28:53.680
Pingyuan, what are you talking about?

28:54.520 --> 28:55.920
Before we left this time,

28:56.040 --> 28:57.070
Mother told me

28:57.590 --> 28:59.640
to treat this as a chance
to see the world with you.

28:59.640 --> 29:00.960
Whether we succeed in business or not

29:00.960 --> 29:01.890
doesn't matter.

29:02.070 --> 29:03.590
The most important thing is to stay safe.

29:03.590 --> 29:04.070
You too,

29:04.120 --> 29:05.480
just take it as a chance to relax.

29:05.480 --> 29:07.480
Don't keep thinking about Miss Bai.

29:10.160 --> 29:12.020
I've already thought it through.

29:12.600 --> 29:13.840
Yimei is a person,

29:13.870 --> 29:14.880
not an object.

29:15.400 --> 29:16.750
Whom she likes or doesn't like

29:16.750 --> 29:17.810
is her own freedom.

29:17.880 --> 29:20.480
Even her father can't
make that choice for her.

29:22.200 --> 29:23.410
But some people

29:23.880 --> 29:24.790
are different.

29:28.350 --> 29:30.280
She's hurting you from the inside.

29:31.340 --> 29:32.670
It's like suddenly sobering up
in the middle of the night,

29:32.670 --> 29:34.600
pushing the pillow aside to sit up,

29:35.880 --> 29:37.940
and feeling a tightness in the chest,

29:38.500 --> 29:40.200
as if you can't breathe.

29:43.680 --> 29:45.350
Pingyuan, you're acting
so strangely today.

29:45.350 --> 29:46.200
What's wrong?

29:48.700 --> 29:50.160
I've had too much to drink.

30:02.680 --> 30:04.290
I wanted to give you a gift.

30:05.820 --> 30:07.470
I read in a book

30:07.790 --> 30:10.400
that scholars exchange poems

30:08.190 --> 30:11.610
♪ Names being etched
and centered in the time ♪

30:10.440 --> 30:11.770
when bidding farewell.

30:12.230 --> 30:15.470
♪ A goose flying across the barren plains,
carrying the setting sun's last light ♪

30:13.350 --> 30:15.080
I don't know how to write poems.

30:15.400 --> 30:16.480
I'll recite a few lines

30:16.330 --> 30:23.520
♪ An old friend suddenly comes to mind,
and the world feels vast and desolate ♪

30:17.110 --> 30:19.040
I read this morning to send you off.

30:22.200 --> 30:23.530
"Gloomy winds and rain;

30:24.430 --> 30:27.640
♪ You point toward the cooking smoke ♪

30:24.640 --> 30:26.300
roosters crow without cease.

30:26.720 --> 30:28.160
Having met you, my dear...

30:28.160 --> 30:31.510
♪ Saying time
has brewed its own fragrance ♪

30:30.590 --> 30:31.990
how could I not rejoice?"

30:32.340 --> 30:40.230
♪ Even when hair turns grey, we'll still
gaze at each other, fingers entwined ♪

30:41.000 --> 30:45.010
♪ The Milky Way spans the west window ♪

30:46.210 --> 30:49.240
Suddenly, a familiar face comes to mind—

30:51.540 --> 30:56.110
half frowning, half smiling—
leaving me utterly uncertain.

31:06.240 --> 31:07.280
Daughter,

31:07.480 --> 31:09.740
are you happy with your trip to Shandong?

31:09.920 --> 31:11.320
I've taken another job

31:11.350 --> 31:13.680
in Wuyuan, Jiangxi.

31:13.960 --> 31:15.130
I have

31:15.200 --> 31:16.880
many friends among the outlaws there,

31:16.880 --> 31:18.350
and the scenery is beautiful.

31:18.350 --> 31:20.280
Let's go there and have a good time.

31:26.680 --> 31:27.550
Can we not go?

31:31.720 --> 31:33.850
I want you to rest for a couple of years.

31:34.110 --> 31:35.710
It makes me look so unfilial.

31:38.160 --> 31:39.920
Now you're lecturing me.

31:41.240 --> 31:43.510
Then at least try to be happier.

31:49.880 --> 31:50.790
In life, you must

31:50.790 --> 31:53.050
learn to take things up and let things go.

32:06.660 --> 32:10.370
[Capital Wharf]

32:10.180 --> 32:11.270
You must be Master Gu Pingyuan

32:11.270 --> 32:12.520
from Anhui, right?

32:12.830 --> 32:13.440
Who are you?

32:13.440 --> 32:15.210
I work for Madam Jin.

32:15.400 --> 32:16.030
My surname is Cui.

32:16.030 --> 32:17.830
You can just call me Manager Cui.

32:18.070 --> 32:19.680
So you're a friend from Hengchang Bank.

32:19.680 --> 32:20.310
Thank you for your trouble.

32:20.310 --> 32:21.750
Please be careful
when unloading the goods.

32:21.750 --> 32:23.080
Guys, unload the goods!

32:23.110 --> 32:24.130
Careful now!

32:24.310 --> 32:24.720
Master Gu,

32:24.720 --> 32:25.350
this way, please.

32:25.350 --> 32:25.720
Second Master Gu,

32:25.720 --> 32:26.180
please!

32:27.270 --> 32:28.600
Keep going, keep going.

32:31.920 --> 32:32.450
This way.

32:32.960 --> 32:33.560
Pingyuan,

32:33.680 --> 32:36.010
you've got quite a few friends in Beijing.

32:39.000 --> 32:39.960
The last time I left

32:39.960 --> 32:40.810
this place,

32:41.350 --> 32:42.270
I was in shackles and chains,

32:42.270 --> 32:43.470
being escorted away.

32:44.720 --> 32:46.550
If it weren't absolutely necessary,

32:46.550 --> 32:48.510
I'd never want to
come back here in my life.

32:48.510 --> 32:50.040
Come on, Master Gu. Please.

32:50.900 --> 32:52.100
This is the carriage.

33:02.640 --> 33:03.290
Ms. Su,

33:03.350 --> 33:05.080
what brings you to the capital?

33:05.590 --> 33:07.160
I heard your Grand Tea Competition

33:07.160 --> 33:08.690
is going to be quite lively.

33:08.790 --> 33:10.330
I came to beg for a cup of tea.

33:10.440 --> 33:11.170
Is that okay?

33:21.850 --> 33:24.190
Merchants attending
the Grand Tea Competition

33:22.740 --> 33:27.460
[Prince Gong's Mansion]

33:24.440 --> 33:26.250
must present tokens
issued by the Ministry of Revenue

33:26.250 --> 33:27.850
for identity verification!

33:28.160 --> 33:29.420
Intruders

33:29.680 --> 33:31.210
will be severely punished!

33:32.600 --> 33:33.750
We're done for.

33:34.240 --> 33:36.240
Your friend has really screwed us over.

33:36.240 --> 33:38.240
If he doesn't come, how can we get in?

33:40.350 --> 33:41.270
This is bad.

33:43.350 --> 33:44.310
Who closed the door?

33:44.310 --> 33:45.150
Who closed it?

33:49.680 --> 33:50.440
Who's there?

33:53.840 --> 33:54.990
Let me out!

33:55.940 --> 33:57.060
Who's outside?

33:57.590 --> 33:58.260
Young Master,

33:58.260 --> 33:59.450
just for today!

33:59.510 --> 34:01.270
The master has given a strict order:

34:01.270 --> 34:02.850
if you take even half a step outside,

34:02.850 --> 34:04.310
it's the path to your death!

34:04.310 --> 34:06.460
-You can't go anywhere!
-Path to my death? Nonsense!

34:06.460 --> 34:07.530
Don't you dare!

34:07.720 --> 34:09.190
I've already made plans with him!

34:09.190 --> 34:10.120
Open the door!

34:11.440 --> 34:12.150
Don't just stand there.

34:12.150 --> 34:13.280
Think of something.

34:16.070 --> 34:17.290
A mansion this big

34:17.360 --> 34:18.760
can't have just one gate.

34:18.880 --> 34:19.880
Let's look around

34:20.040 --> 34:21.030
and see if there are other doors

34:21.030 --> 34:21.760
we can enter.

34:22.739 --> 34:23.300
That way.

34:24.699 --> 34:28.239
[Prince Gong's Mansion]

34:41.800 --> 34:43.920
[Phoenix Singing in the Bamboo Grove]

34:52.420 --> 34:56.900
[Grand Tea Competition]

34:56.940 --> 34:59.760
[Guangdong Tea Merchants]

34:59.810 --> 35:01.080
[Fujian Tea Merchants' Association]

35:01.140 --> 35:02.130
[Sichuan Tea Merchants' Association]

35:02.130 --> 35:03.350
[Zhejiang Tea Merchants' Association]

35:03.460 --> 35:07.540
[Anhui Tea Merchants' Association]

35:21.670 --> 35:22.130
Come on.

35:22.400 --> 35:23.130
Give it to me.

35:29.150 --> 35:30.560
Eunuch, you look well!

35:31.730 --> 35:33.110
Please rise, please rise.

35:33.110 --> 35:34.960
Having the God of Wealth bow to me—

35:34.960 --> 35:37.130
what an honor.

35:37.960 --> 35:39.360
Eunuch, you're radiant.

35:39.360 --> 35:41.450
Clearly, you've made great progress
in your cultivation.

35:41.450 --> 35:43.310
You must be close to immortality!

35:43.840 --> 35:44.790
Not at all.

35:45.030 --> 35:45.920
I cultivate

35:45.960 --> 35:47.580
just to live a few more years

35:47.620 --> 35:49.280
to better serve His Highness.

35:49.280 --> 35:50.000
Yes, of course.

35:50.000 --> 35:50.860
Now, excuse me.

35:51.630 --> 35:52.090
Please.

36:05.920 --> 36:06.780
There's a door.

36:07.000 --> 36:07.630
Hurry.

36:14.190 --> 36:15.150
You reckless fool,

36:15.150 --> 36:16.080
what's the rush?

36:16.570 --> 36:17.550
Are you in a hurry to die?

36:17.550 --> 36:18.610
What are you doing?

36:18.670 --> 36:20.670
If I drop this on your account,
you definitely can't afford it!

36:20.670 --> 36:21.970
Such big talk.

36:22.150 --> 36:24.030
Bragging with nothing to show for it.

36:24.030 --> 36:25.430
You asking for a beating?

36:26.710 --> 36:27.770
Did you fall or not?

36:28.730 --> 36:29.730
Let them go first.

36:30.190 --> 36:30.790
After you.

36:32.780 --> 36:34.280
What are you holding in your arms?

36:34.280 --> 36:35.540
You guard it like gold.

36:35.630 --> 36:37.960
I'm afraid you'll be shocked
if I tell you.

36:38.360 --> 36:39.800
Then go ahead and shock me.

36:39.800 --> 36:41.030
I haven't known

36:41.070 --> 36:43.070
what fear feels like for a long time.

36:45.240 --> 36:46.770
It's our family's Orchid Snow tea.

36:46.770 --> 36:48.550
Ordinary folks can't afford this.

36:48.550 --> 36:51.000
It's the champion tea
of the Grand Tea Competition!

36:51.000 --> 36:52.430
Blowing hot air, are we?

36:52.550 --> 36:54.230
The Grand Tea Competition has just begun.

36:54.230 --> 36:55.230
How is it that your champion tea

36:55.230 --> 36:56.490
isn't even inside yet?

36:57.520 --> 36:59.120
We don't have the entry pass.

36:59.140 --> 37:00.990
This rascal is quite amusing.

37:01.630 --> 37:02.320
Let him come in

37:02.320 --> 37:03.390
with us.

37:04.720 --> 37:06.490
I'd like to taste this tea.

37:07.670 --> 37:09.360
Orchid Snow tea...

37:11.070 --> 37:12.500
That's a nice name.

37:12.550 --> 37:14.710
Is that a man or a woman I was arguing with?

37:14.710 --> 37:15.590
Why do people in the capital sound

37:15.590 --> 37:16.550
so androgynous?

37:17.510 --> 37:18.310
Androgynous?

37:19.480 --> 37:20.880
Looks like a eunuch to me.

37:22.630 --> 37:24.400
Keep your mouth shut once we get inside.

37:24.400 --> 37:24.930
Let's go.

37:30.880 --> 37:34.360
Prince Gong and Prince Chun have arrived!

37:37.110 --> 37:38.930
Your servant pays respects to
Your Highness Prince Gong!

37:38.750 --> 37:39.860
[Prince Gong]

37:39.110 --> 37:40.360
Greetings, Your Highness Prince Chun.

37:40.100 --> 37:41.250
[Prince Chun]

37:41.880 --> 37:42.740
Your Highness,

37:42.920 --> 37:44.230
the tea merchants' associations

37:44.230 --> 37:46.090
from all provinces are ready now.

37:46.110 --> 37:47.710
We await your instructions.

37:54.190 --> 37:55.160
[Zhejiang Tea Merchants' Association]

37:55.190 --> 37:56.610
[Sichuan Tea Merchants' Association]

37:56.710 --> 38:02.290
[Virtue Shines Through Time]

37:57.920 --> 37:58.920
His Highness says

37:59.110 --> 38:02.040
to start with
the Anhui Tea Merchants' Association!

38:04.550 --> 38:05.350
Much obliged.

38:05.480 --> 38:06.280
Much obliged!

38:07.770 --> 38:08.270
[Sichuan Tea Merchants' Association]

38:08.350 --> 38:09.340
[Zhejiang Tea Merchants' Association]

38:10.320 --> 38:11.120
Much obliged.

38:18.280 --> 38:18.780
Stop.

38:19.920 --> 38:20.500
Officer,

38:20.630 --> 38:22.680
we're participants
in the Grand Tea Competition.

38:22.680 --> 38:23.710
If you stop us,

38:24.230 --> 38:26.230
you can't afford the consequences
of delaying us.

38:26.230 --> 38:27.960
You may have gotten through the main gate,

38:27.960 --> 38:30.690
but do you know how to get through
the second gate?

38:30.840 --> 38:31.370
Officer,

38:31.590 --> 38:32.720
we're country folk.

38:32.750 --> 38:33.510
We got through the main gate

38:33.510 --> 38:35.030
with help from someone from our hometown.

38:35.030 --> 38:36.140
So, please tell us

38:36.320 --> 38:37.550
how to get through the second gate.

38:37.550 --> 38:39.110
The entry fee for the second gate—

38:39.110 --> 38:39.840
5,000 taels.

38:39.880 --> 38:40.610
5,000 taels?

38:41.800 --> 38:43.260
For you two, 10,000 taels.

38:43.440 --> 38:44.150
And you must clearly state

38:44.150 --> 38:45.920
which tea merchants' association
you belong to.

38:45.920 --> 38:47.320
I'll have to send someone

38:47.630 --> 38:48.800
to get your association's head

38:48.800 --> 38:49.880
to come and claim you.

38:49.880 --> 38:51.680
Only then will I let you through.

38:53.190 --> 38:53.990
I understand.

38:56.110 --> 38:57.710
What should we do, Pingyuan?

39:02.560 --> 39:03.480
I can pay

39:03.510 --> 39:04.750
the 10,000 taels,

39:05.630 --> 39:06.280
but if you're expecting

39:06.280 --> 39:07.000
that Old Master Hu

39:07.000 --> 39:07.760
to come and take us in,

39:07.760 --> 39:09.320
that's absolutely impossible.

39:09.320 --> 39:11.720
I told you
we shouldn't have offended them.

39:18.870 --> 39:36.440
Hand in hand toward the garden...

39:33.530 --> 39:35.170
[Yunnan Tea Merchants' Association]

39:41.070 --> 39:41.920
This tea is only grown

39:41.920 --> 39:44.520
in the southern foothills
of Mount Huangshan.

39:44.630 --> 39:47.800
It grows in secluded mountain valleys,
with dense branches and lush leaves.

39:47.800 --> 39:49.510
This tea, with its single stem and bud,

39:49.510 --> 39:50.590
once processed,

39:50.920 --> 39:53.580
resembles a silver dragon
entering the palace.

39:58.100 --> 39:59.740
[Anhui Tea Merchants' Association]

40:05.460 --> 40:06.400
Brother, look.

40:06.880 --> 40:08.150
The Anhui tea merchants

40:08.150 --> 40:09.610
even brought a performer.

40:10.370 --> 40:12.290
[Anhui Tea Merchants' Association]

40:12.220 --> 40:12.870
Brother,

40:13.270 --> 40:14.670
who are you trying to fool?

40:14.670 --> 40:15.920
I've never heard of that.

40:15.920 --> 40:17.300
Just brewing green leaves directly.

40:17.300 --> 40:18.630
I know about this. It needs to be roasted

40:18.630 --> 40:19.830
and heat-treated...

40:19.920 --> 40:21.390
Calm down.

40:21.630 --> 40:22.590
Those tea merchants from Anhui

40:22.590 --> 40:24.110
have transported such a large tea tree

40:24.110 --> 40:25.150
all the way to the capital.

40:25.150 --> 40:26.710
They put in quite some thought.

40:26.710 --> 40:28.190
Just wait and see.

40:28.440 --> 40:30.190
This tea

40:30.230 --> 40:31.070
is quite interesting.

40:31.070 --> 40:32.710
I've never had tea like this before.

40:32.710 --> 40:33.550
How can I drink any other tea

40:33.550 --> 40:34.250
after this?

40:57.860 --> 40:58.470
Stop.

40:58.720 --> 41:00.590
I'm from
the Hubei Tea Merchants' Association.

41:00.590 --> 41:01.480
The entry fee is 5,500 taels.

41:01.480 --> 41:02.140
Search him.

41:02.800 --> 41:04.660
Why did it go up by 500 taels again?

41:44.110 --> 41:45.670
The Anhui Tea Merchants' Association

41:45.670 --> 41:47.530
presents to Your Highness

41:47.550 --> 41:51.340
the finest Tunxi Silver Bud.

42:03.600 --> 42:05.440
[Anhui Tea Merchants' Association]

42:08.670 --> 42:09.470
Here it comes.

42:11.550 --> 42:12.280
Let's try it.

42:12.360 --> 42:13.590
Freshly roasted tea.

42:30.440 --> 42:31.440
Your Highnesses,

42:31.480 --> 42:32.820
this is the Tunxi Silver Bud
respectfully presented

42:32.820 --> 42:35.150
by the Anhui Tea Merchants' Association.

42:36.000 --> 42:36.670
Brother,

42:36.950 --> 42:38.230
just for the effort alone,

42:38.230 --> 42:39.690
it deserves the top prize.

42:40.400 --> 42:41.440
What's the rush?

42:42.030 --> 42:43.770
Plenty of people are lining up
to present their tea.

42:43.770 --> 42:45.430
Let's take our time and enjoy.

42:46.320 --> 42:47.650
We've come all this way,

42:48.000 --> 42:49.190
yet haven't even caught a glimpse

42:49.190 --> 42:50.850
of the Grand Tea Competition.

42:50.880 --> 42:52.880
If only we could go in and join the fun,

42:52.880 --> 42:55.540
I'd have something to brag about
when I get back.

42:57.190 --> 42:58.490
Why don't you go in?

42:58.630 --> 43:00.550
Weren't you going to win the championship?

43:00.550 --> 43:01.880
Isn't that the effeminate one?
